<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Tandy Q4 EPS cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Tandy Q4 EPS cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Salomon Brothers said it cut fourth-quarter share earnings estimate on Tandy Corp to $1.30 from $1.60.</p>
<p>-- The stock lost one to 39.</p>
</text>
